name: telecom-subscription-ring
label: Subscription ring (shared identity)
category: telecom
description: Five or more lines registered on the same identity document or address within one week. Start from any line in the ring - each one is linked to all the others. Lower the count for smaller households only with care, since families and two-line customers share an address too.
stages[1]{shape,minBranches,edgeKind,nodeKind,windowHours,afterPrevious,maxGapHours,thresholdAttr,thresholdMin,thresholdMax,closesToStart}:
  fan-in,5,shared_identity,"",168,false,0,"","","",false
